          <p>Roli, akshat, wicks, kapoor, mauli and other small essentials are easy to miss when bought separately.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="sp-navratri__visual-emoji">⏰</span>
          <h3>Festival-day rushing</h3>
          <p>A missing basic can mean another market run just when the home is getting ready for puja.</p>
